{"id":525,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由と自律で学びを選ぶ立教池袋の学び","feature_description":"立教池袋は、テーマをもって真理を探究する力と共に生きる力を教育目標に掲げ、キリスト教に基づく人間教育を大切にしています。一貫校ならではの多彩な学びと学友会活動を通じて、興味関心を深めながら自由と自律を育てる校風です。大学との連携や主体的な選択学習も特徴で、学びと活動を往復しながら自分らしさを磨けます。学年を越えた交流も豊かで、落ち着きと活気の両方があります。","clubs":[{"id":10333,"name":"中学バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/athletic/athletic.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10334,"name":"高校バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/athletic/athletic.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10335,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/athletic/athletic.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10336,"name":"高校野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/athletic/athletic.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10337,"name":"数理研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10338,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10339,"name":"聖ポーロ会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10340,"name":"地歴研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10341,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10342,"name":"天文部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10343,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikebukuro.rikkyo.ac.jp/club/cultural/cultural.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10344,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://